<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 362 0 R
/E (Documentation of Requirements \(RD\) describes the requirements for Jaguard to operate. Jaguard provides breach monitoring solutions via the cloud. In this document, developers and project managers can review all requirements and agree on their implementation before the project begins. The document was created based on the market analysis and review of current breach monitoring systems.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
433 0 obj
<<
